<title>UK: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF KOURNIKOVA V MAJOLI.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF KOURNIKOVA V MAJOLI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of the quarter-final</p>
<p>match between Anna Kournikova of Russia and Iva Majoli of</p>
<p>Croatia at Wimbledon on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Kournikova won 7-6 6-4</p>
<p>Time: One hour and 18 minutes</p>
<p>				  KOURNIKOVAMAJOLI</p>
<p>Aces21</p>
<p>Double faults24</p>
<p>Percentage first serves in    5565</p>
<p>Percentage unreturned serves    2314</p>
<p>Forehand winners    159</p>
<p>Backhand winners     47</p>
<p>Volley winners     33</p>
<p>Passing winners     11</p>
<p>Return winners     51</p>
<p>Percentage returns in    8677</p>
<p>Break points     97</p>
<p>Break points won     54</p>
